+<div class="titlepage">
+<div class='center'>
+<h1>The httplib2 Library</h1>
+<p><b><font size="+2">Joe Gregorio</font></b></p>
+<p>
+Email: <span class="email">joe@bitworking.org</span>
+</p>
+<p><strong>Release 0.3</strong><br />
+<strong>Mar 8, 2007</strong></p>
+<p></p>
+</div>
+</div>
